cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, cite this repository and the NVIDIA model cards listed in THIRD_PARTY_MODELS.md."
title: "Industrial Catalog Extractor: an evidence-preserving NVIDIA VLM-to-RAG pipeline"
type: software
url: "https://github.com/MohdMuzakkiruddinAhmed/Industrial-Catalog-Extractor"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MohdMuzakkiruddinAhmed/Industrial-Catalog-Extractor"
authors:
  - name: "Industrial Catalog Extractor contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-07
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A research implementation for routing industrial PDF pages,
  extracting grounded document evidence with NVIDIA Nemotron Parse, producing
  schema-constrained product records with Nemotron Nano, validating evidence
  lineage, and building a citation-bearing SQLite RAG knowledge base with
  NVIDIA Nemotron embeddings.
keywords:
  - document AI
  - industrial catalogs
  - NVIDIA Nemotron
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - vision-language model
